{"5045510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WinterSeed", "steam_appid": 5045510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WinterSeed</i> is a graduate capstone project created by a five-member team of Master of Animation and Visual Effects students from UNSW Sydney. Led by Wolfe, the game was developed over eight weeks as a collaborative real-time game production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WinterSeed</i> is a narrative-driven 2.5D puzzle platformer that follows <strong>Miri</strong>, a curious young adventurer, on a journey through a world shaped by the <strong>Gods of the Four Seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through mysterious forests, dangerous caves, frozen lands and other changing environments as Miri uncovers the secrets behind the seasons. Along the way, players must explore the world, solve environmental puzzles, avoid dangers, transform into different forms to overcome obstacles, and use unique traversal mechanics to progress through the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its heart, <i>WinterSeed</i> is an adventure about <strong>courage, wisdom and hope</strong>, combining exploration, storytelling and puzzle-platforming within a stylised 3D world presented from a 2.5D perspective.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WinterSeed</i> is a graduate capstone project created by a five-member team of Master of Animation and Visual Effects students from UNSW Sydney. Led by Wolfe, the game was developed over eight weeks as a collaborative real-time game production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WinterSeed</i> is a narrative-driven 2.5D puzzle platformer that follows <strong>Miri</strong>, a curious young adventurer, on a journey through a world shaped by the <strong>Gods of the Four Seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through mysterious forests, dangerous caves, frozen lands and other changing environments as Miri uncovers the secrets behind the seasons. Along the way, players must explore the world, solve environmental puzzles, avoid dangers, transform into different forms to overcome obstacles, and use unique traversal mechanics to progress through the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its heart, <i>WinterSeed</i> is an adventure about <strong>courage, wisdom and hope</strong>, combining exploration, storytelling and puzzle-platforming within a stylised 3D world presented from a 2.5D perspective.</p>", "short_description": "WinterSeed is a 2.5D puzzle platformer created by five UNSW Master of Animation and Visual Effects students. Follow Miri on an adventure connected to the Gods of the Four Seasons, exploring mysterious lands, solving puzzles, and discovering a story of courage, wisdom, and hope.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045510/b0e7a57bc271ee252245ad19bcc25f297f71018b/header.jpg?t=1787970237", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045510/b7d94b20151e96f2f3619be5a9a93459c108e5d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787970237", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5045510/b7d94b20151e96f2f3619be5a9a93459c108e5d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787970237", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6GB / AMD RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2110 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Wolf Studio"], "publishers": ["Wolf Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": fa